iest man in the world, dies tragically during a cruise. The director of an American newspaper, wondering about the meaning of these intriguing final words, asks his three best investigators, Dave, Peter and Steven, to solve the mystery. (Sixteen French actors dub scenes from various Warner Bros. films to create a parody of Citizen Kane, 1941.)","tagline":"Attention! This flim is not a flim about cyclign."},{"iso_639_1":"fr","iso_3166_1":"FR","name":"Français","english_name":"French","title":"","overview":"George Abitbol, l'homme le plus classe du monde, meurt tragiquement lors d'une croisière. Dans un dernier souffle, il murmure : « Monde de merde ». Pourquoi ? Ces mots intriguent le rédacteur en chef d'un quotidien américain. Il dépêche ses trois meilleurs enquêteurs, Dave, Peter et Steven, pour éclaircir ce mystère.","tagline":"La classe c'est un etat d'esprit"},{"iso_639_1":"de","iso_3166_1":"DE","name":"Deutsch","english_name":"German","title":"","overview":"George Abitbol, der vornehmste Mann der Welt, stirbt auf tragische Weise während einer Kreuzfahrt. Der Direktor einer amerikanischen Zeitung, der sich über die Bedeutung dieser rätselhaften letzten Worte wundert, bittet seine drei besten Ermittler Dave, Peter und Steven, das Rätsel zu lösen.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"nl","iso_3166_1":"NL","name":"Nederlands","english_name":"Dutch","title":"","overview":"George Abitbol, de deftigste man ter wereld, sterft op tragische wijze tijdens een cruise. De directeur van een Amerikaanse krant, die zich afvraagt wat deze intrigerende laatste woorden betekenen, vraagt zijn drie beste speurders, Dave, Peter en Steven, het mysterie op te lossen.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"CN","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"美国格调","overview":"","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ru","iso_3166_1":"RU","name":"Pусский","english_name":"Russian","title":"Американское путешествие","overview":"Джордж Эбитбол, «самый лучший человек на Земле», умирает, бормоча свои последние слова: «Чертов мир!» Что именно он подразумевает? Репортеры Стивен, Питер и Дейв начинают расследование.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"HK","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"美國格調","overview":"","tagline":""}],"videos":[{"key":"CJaJEyuMozo","site":"YouTube","type":"Trailer","name":"Bande-annonce","iso_639_1":"fr","official":false,"published_at":"2013-08-30T09:11:31.000Z","size":1080}],"images":{"posters":[{"file_path":"/iQKZwYLsaJIATKeS5t4yVoKzMxV.jpg","width":800,"height":1200,"iso_639_1":"fr","vote_average":3.666,"vote_count":15},{"file_path":"/hSjNpYyz3eeS1PWD3iF7D3Et6yX.jpg","width":1425,"height":2138,"iso_639_1":"fr","vote_average":7.764,"vote_count":17},{"file_path":"/hLKCSR5EQrkGvHF3gZCkmKPi5Yw.jpg","width":500,"height":750,"iso_639_1":"fr","vote_average":1.75,"vote_count":3},{"file_path":"/vi4Ib8X9oyBOClN7egSK3BJJfTg.jpg","width":960,"height":1440,"iso_639_1":"fr","vote_average":1.75,"vote_count":2},{"file_path":"/8tlWvxJe3RiaqpajLhShjAAL9as.jpg","width":1000,"height":1500,"iso_639_1":"fr","vote_average":1.222,"vote_count":3},{"file_path":"/xJ531Dq39Hzzb5cw7eKCLchNZxP.jpg","width":500,"height":750,"iso_639_1":"fr","vote_average":0.166,"vote_count":1},{"file_path":"/qaUrsEVntaUlXCUXXsjiyl0VeJS.jpg","width":1440,"height":2160,"iso_639_1":"fr","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0}],"backdrops":[{"file_path":"/wD7pJC0ZpGAzBSczXnf3dHuexLq.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080,"iso_639_1":null,"vote_average":2.278,"vote_count":3},{"file_path":"/1vEEFAaDnZLuOnS3wjamtdsSqCm.jpg","width":1280,"height":720,"iso_639_1":"fr","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},{"file_path":"/9PCc6PC0bZJOUCJMYciiQhxn6R4.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080,"iso_639_1":null,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},{"file_path":"/cgI1Ne4nJx0PO1LGiOWCbHhQmSZ.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080,"iso_639_1":"fr","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0}],"logos":[{"file_path":"/zSFQbdwZQYALHg2mh5AF8SxrMuj.png","width":1000,"height":360,"iso_639_1":"fr","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},{"file_pat